This project is an independent Rust/PyO3 port of the ROS (Regression on Order
Statistics) and bootstrap routines from wqio
(https://github.com/International-BMP-Database/wqio), by the same author.

It contains no wqio source code. wqio is used only as a development dependency,
to cross-check this port's numerical output against the reference implementation
(see tools/check_against_wqio.py). At runtime polars-ros does not import wqio
and depends only on polars.

wqio is distributed separately under the BSD-3-Clause license, at
https://github.com/International-BMP-Database/wqio/blob/main/LICENSE

